###  2B — Missing Values (NULL) Check

**SQL Query:**
```sql
SELECT 
    SUM(CASE WHEN sale_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_sale_id,
    SUM(CASE WHEN sale_date IS NULL OR sale_date='' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_date,
    SUM(CASE WHEN product_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_product_id,
    SUM(CASE WHEN customer_id IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_customer_id,
    SUM(CASE WHEN total IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_total,
    SUM(CASE WHEN rating IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS null_rating
FROM sales;
```

**Output:**
```
null_sale_id  null_date  null_product_id  null_customer_id  null_total  null_rating
------------  ---------  ---------------  ----------------  ----------  -----------
0             0          0                0                 0           0
```

**Finding:**  **No missing values in any table** — all 4 tables are complete.

